{"title":"Career Roadmap · Aircraft Maintenance Engineer (B1/B2)","role":"Aircraft Maintenance Engineer (B1/B2)","summary":"An Aircraft Maintenance Engineer (AME) is responsible for the inspection, maintenance, troubleshooting, certification and continuing airworthiness of aircraft within the scope of the engineer's licence, aircraft type authorization and organizational approvals.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Aircraft Maintenance Engineering (AME – DGCA)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Aircraft Maintenance Engineer (AME) is responsible for the inspection, maintenance, troubleshooting, certification and continuing airworthiness of aircraft within the scope of the engineer's licence, aircraft type authorization and organizational approvals."},{"type":"p","text":"For the Indian DGCA pathway, B1 and B2 are licence categories under CAR-66. DGCA conducts AME examinations using the CAR-66 modular examination system. Current DGCA material also shows that the syllabus is governed by CAR-66 Issue III, Revision 2 dated 29 September 2025. Pariksha DGCA","url":"https://www.pariksha.dgca.gov.in/Form/About_US"},{"type":"p","text":"Broadly:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B1 → mechanical maintenance, including structures, powerplant, mechanical and associated electrical systems"},{"text":"B2 → avionics and electrical systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact privileges, limitations, experience requirements, type ratings and certification authority depend on the applicable CAR-66 category/subcategory, licence status, aircraft type and approved maintenance organization."},{"type":"note","label":"Important qualification point","text":"a B.Tech/B.E. degree or AME academic program by itself should not be treated as equivalent to holding a DGCA AME licence. The student must follow the applicable DGCA/CAR-66 examination, experience, licensing and type-authorization pathway. DGCA's current portal states that AME examinations are conducted under CAR-66 and that eligibility/application requirements are governed by the current regulatory documents. Pariksha DGCA"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Tech/AME Training + DGCA Pathway"},{"text":"Aircraft systems, maintenance practices, CAR-66 modules, practical experience"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"AME Trainee / Junior Maintenance Engineer"},{"text":"Aircraft maintenance, troubleshooting, inspections and maintenance documentation"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Licensed/Type-Qualified B1/B2 AME"},{"text":"Aircraft certification, defect rectification, troubleshooting and maintenance leadership"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Senior AME / Technical Services / Maintenance Lead"},{"text":"Advanced troubleshooting, reliability, continuing airworthiness and maintenance management"}]]}]},{"heading":"Build the Aviation Foundation","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Aircraft & Engineering Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mathematics"},{"text":"Algebra"},{"text":"Calculus"},{"text":"Differential equations"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Numerical methods"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Physics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mechanics"},{"text":"Thermodynamics"},{"text":"Fluid mechanics"},{"text":"Electricity"},{"text":"Magnetism"},{"text":"Waves"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Aviation Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft configuration"},{"text":"Aircraft categories"},{"text":"Airworthiness"},{"text":"Aircraft operating environment"},{"text":"Maintenance philosophy"},{"text":"Aircraft documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Aircraft Structure"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fuselage"},{"text":"Wings"},{"text":"Empennage"},{"text":"Flight-control surfaces"},{"text":"Landing gear"},{"text":"Doors"},{"text":"Windows"},{"text":"Fairings"},{"text":"Control surfaces"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand structural materials:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aluminium alloys"},{"text":"Titanium"},{"text":"Steel"},{"text":"Composite materials"},{"text":"Honeycomb structures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Aircraft Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a system-level understanding of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flight controls"},{"text":"Landing gear"},{"text":"Hydraulic systems"},{"text":"Pneumatic systems"},{"text":"Fuel systems"},{"text":"Electrical systems"},{"text":"Environmental control"},{"text":"Pressurization"},{"text":"Ice and rain protection"},{"text":"Fire protection"},{"text":"Oxygen systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"B1 vs B2 Orientation"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should decide early whether the stronger specialization is:"},{"type":"h","text":"B1"},{"type":"flow","items":["Aircraft","Structures"]},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"+"},{"text":"Engines"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Hydraulics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Pneumatics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Landing Gear"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Mechanical Systems"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Associated Electrical Systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"B2"},{"type":"flow","items":["Aircraft","Avionics"]},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"+"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Navigation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Instrumentation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Flight Control Electronics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Electrical / Electronic Systems"},{"text":"A candidate can pursue the applicable B1/B2 pathway subject to the current regulatory requirements."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1–2 — Aircraft Maintenance Practices"},{"type":"p","text":"Maintenance practice is different from merely learning aircraft theory."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Maintenance tools"},{"text":"Tool control"},{"text":"Torque procedures"},{"text":"Safety wiring"},{"text":"Lock-wiring"},{"text":"Fasteners"},{"text":"Riveting"},{"text":"Bonding"},{"text":"Sealing"},{"text":"Lubrication"},{"text":"Cleaning"},{"text":"Inspection"},{"text":"Component removal/installation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Aircraft Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable reading:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AMM — Aircraft Maintenance Manual"},{"text":"IPC — Illustrated Parts Catalogue"},{"text":"SRM — Structural Repair Manual"},{"text":"FIM — Fault Isolation Manual"},{"text":"CMM — Component Maintenance Manual"},{"text":"WDM — Wiring Diagram Manual"},{"text":"MEL — Minimum Equipment List"},{"text":"CDL — Configuration Deviation List"},{"text":"AD — Airworthiness Directive"},{"text":"SB — Service Bulletin"},{"text":"These documents are fundamental to professional aircraft maintenance."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Maintenance Documentation Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Aircraft Defect","Technical Log","Troubleshooting / Fault Isolation","Approved Maintenance Data","Inspection / Test","Rectification","Functional Test","Maintenance Record","Certification / Release"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Aircraft Engines"},{"type":"h","text":"Turbine Engines"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Air intake"},{"text":"Compressor"},{"text":"Combustion chamber"},{"text":"Turbine"},{"text":"Exhaust"},{"text":"Accessory gearbox"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compression"},{"text":"Combustion"},{"text":"Expansion"},{"text":"Thrust generation"},{"text":"Engine performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Engine Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fuel"},{"text":"Oil"},{"text":"Starting"},{"text":"Ignition"},{"text":"Air"},{"text":"Engine control"},{"text":"Fire protection"},{"text":"Thrust reversal"},{"text":"Indication systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Engine Monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EGT"},{"text":"N1/N2"},{"text":"Oil pressure"},{"text":"Oil temperature"},{"text":"Fuel flow"},{"text":"Vibration"},{"text":"Engine pressure ratio concepts"},{"text":"Use maintenance data to identify abnormal trends."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Piston Engines"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the applicable category/pathway, understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reciprocating engines"},{"text":"Cylinders"},{"text":"Pistons"},{"text":"Crankshaft"},{"text":"Valves"},{"text":"Ignition"},{"text":"Carburation/fuel injection"},{"text":"Lubrication"},{"text":"Cooling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3 — Aircraft Electrical Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DC systems"},{"text":"AC systems"},{"text":"Generators"},{"text":"Batteries"},{"text":"Transformers"},{"text":"Rectifiers"},{"text":"Inverters"},{"text":"Busbars"},{"text":"Circuit protection"},{"text":"External power"},{"text":"Understand aircraft power distribution."}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Engine / APU","Generator","Power Distribution","Busbars","Aircraft Systems"]},{"type":"h","text":"Aircraft Wiring"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wiring diagrams"},{"text":"Wire identification"},{"text":"Connectors"},{"text":"Terminals"},{"text":"Shielding"},{"text":"Grounding"},{"text":"Bonding"},{"text":"Continuity testing"},{"text":"Insulation resistance"},{"text":"Wiring damage"},{"text":"Aircraft wiring requires disciplined inspection and documentation."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Avionics for B2"},{"type":"p","text":"For the B2 pathway, develop deeper knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"VHF"},{"text":"HF"},{"text":"SATCOM concepts"},{"text":"Audio systems"},{"text":"Data communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Navigation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"VOR"},{"text":"DME"},{"text":"ILS"},{"text":"GNSS"},{"text":"ADF"},{"text":"Radio altimeter"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Surveillance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transponder"},{"text":"TCAS"},{"text":"ADS-B concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Flight Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FMS"},{"text":"Flight computers"},{"text":"Navigation databases"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Aircraft Instrumentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airspeed"},{"text":"Altitude"},{"text":"Vertical speed"},{"text":"Heading"},{"text":"Attitude"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Pressure"},{"text":"Engine parameters"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sensors"},{"text":"Transducers"},{"text":"Signal conditioning"},{"text":"Displays"},{"text":"Data buses"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Aircraft Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ARINC 429"},{"text":"ARINC 664 concepts"},{"text":"CAN aerospace concepts"},{"text":"Ethernet-based aircraft networks"},{"text":"Data acquisition"},{"text":"Integrated modular avionics concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"B1/B2 Module Preparation"},{"type":"p","text":"The DGCA AME examination is modular under CAR-66. Current DGCA examination material includes modules such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Electrical Fundamentals"},{"text":"Electronic Fundamentals"},{"text":"Digital Techniques"},{"text":"Materials and Hardware"},{"text":"Maintenance Practices"},{"text":"Basic Aerodynamics"},{"text":"Human Factors"},{"text":"Aviation Legislation"},{"text":"Aircraft-specific aerodynamics, structures and systems"},{"text":"The exact module combination depends on the licence category/subcategory and current DGCA syllabus. Pariksha DGCA","url":"https://pariksha.dgca.gov.in/PDFViewer.jsp?pdf=458087"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Human Factors"},{"type":"p","text":"Human factors are a major aviation-maintenance competency."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fatigue"},{"text":"Stress"},{"text":"Distraction"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Teamwork"},{"text":"Situational awareness"},{"text":"Complacency"},{"text":"Time pressure"},{"text":"Cognitive bias"},{"text":"Shift work"},{"text":"Handover errors"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Human Factors","Maintenance Error","Undetected Defect","Safety Risk"]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to build systems that prevent errors from becoming safety events."},{"type":"h","text":"Aviation Safety Culture"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Just culture awareness"},{"text":"Safety reporting"},{"text":"Error management"},{"text":"Procedural compliance"},{"text":"Independent inspection"},{"text":"Tool accountability"},{"text":"Foreign-object-debris control"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Aircraft Troubleshooting"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn systematic fault isolation."},{"type":"h","text":"B1 Example"},{"type":"flow","items":["Defect","Aircraft History","System Diagram","FIM","Test / Measurement","Fault Isolation","Component / Wiring","Rectification","Functional Test"]},{"type":"h","text":"B2 Example"},{"type":"flow","items":["Avionics Fault","Fault Message","BITE / Diagnostic Data","Wiring / Power Check","LRU Isolation","Test Equipment","Replacement / Rectification","Operational Test"]},{"type":"h","text":"Aircraft Maintenance Tools"},{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Torque wrench"},{"text":"Multimeter"},{"text":"Insulation tester"},{"text":"Bonding meter"},{"text":"Pitot/static test equipment"},{"text":"Hydraulic test equipment"},{"text":"Pressure gauges"},{"text":"Borescope"},{"text":"Oscilloscope"},{"text":"Signal generator"},{"text":"Avionics test equipment"},{"text":"B2 engineers should particularly develop strong electronic test-equipment skills."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4 — Aircraft Structures"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Structural inspection"},{"text":"Corrosion"},{"text":"Cracks"},{"text":"Delamination"},{"text":"Impact damage"},{"text":"Fatigue"},{"text":"Structural repairs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Composite Structures"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Carbon-fibre composites"},{"text":"Glass-fibre composites"},{"text":"Honeycomb structures"},{"text":"Delamination"},{"text":"Impact damage"},{"text":"Moisture effects"},{"text":"Bonding"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Inspection concepts:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Visual"},{"text":"Tap testing"},{"text":"Ultrasonic"},{"text":"Thermography"},{"text":"Other NDT methods"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Non-Destructive Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Visual inspection"},{"text":"Dye penetrant"},{"text":"Magnetic particle"},{"text":"Ultrasonic testing"},{"text":"Eddy current"},{"text":"Radiography"},{"text":"Each method has different material and defect applicability."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Aircraft Maintenance Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scheduled maintenance"},{"text":"Unscheduled maintenance"},{"text":"Transit checks"},{"text":"Daily/weekly checks"},{"text":"A-check concepts"},{"text":"C-check concepts"},{"text":"Heavy maintenance concepts"},{"text":"Exact maintenance programs are aircraft/operator-specific."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Line vs Base Maintenance"},{"type":"h","text":"Line Maintenance"},{"type":"p","text":"Performed around aircraft operations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transit"},{"text":"Turnaround"},{"text":"Overnight"},{"text":"Minor defect rectification"},{"text":"Troubleshooting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Base Maintenance"},{"type":"p","text":"More extensive:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Major inspections"},{"text":"Structural work"},{"text":"Component work"},{"text":"Modifications"},{"text":"Heavy checks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Aircraft Reliability"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"Failure rate"},{"text":"MTBF"},{"text":"MTBUR"},{"text":"Dispatch reliability"},{"text":"Repeat defects"},{"text":"Deferred defects"},{"text":"Component removal rates"},{"text":"Use data to identify recurring failures."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Predictive Maintenance"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern aircraft maintenance increasingly uses:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engine trend monitoring"},{"text":"Aircraft health monitoring"},{"text":"Sensor data"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"AI-assisted fault detection"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Aircraft Sensors","Aircraft Data","Trend Monitoring","Anomaly Detection","Fault Prediction","Maintenance Action"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Continuing Airworthiness"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airworthiness"},{"text":"Maintenance programs"},{"text":"Defect control"},{"text":"Component life"},{"text":"LLP concepts"},{"text":"AD compliance"},{"text":"SB incorporation"},{"text":"Maintenance records"},{"text":"Configuration control"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory Framework"},{"type":"p","text":"For India, develop working knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DGCA"},{"text":"Aircraft Rules"},{"text":"CAR-66"},{"text":"CAR-145"},{"text":"Continuing airworthiness requirements"},{"text":"Approved maintenance organizations"},{"text":"Approved maintenance data"},{"text":"The current DGCA examination portal explicitly identifies CAR-66 as the basis for the modular AME licence examinations. Pariksha DGCA","url":"https://www.pariksha.dgca.gov.in/Form/About_US"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"regulatory requirements change. The current DGCA/CAR-66 documents and official notices should always take precedence over college notes or older AME guides."},{"type":"h","text":"Type Rating & Aircraft Authorization"},{"type":"p","text":"A major career step is moving from general AME knowledge to competence on a specific aircraft type."},{"type":"p","text":"Examples of aircraft families may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airbus A320 family"},{"text":"Boeing 737 family"},{"text":"ATR aircraft"},{"text":"Embraer aircraft"},{"text":"Other operator-specific fleets"},{"text":"The exact type-training, experience and authorization requirements depend on the applicable DGCA pathway and organization."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Maintenance Experience"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should prioritize real aircraft exposure."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft walk-around"},{"text":"Maintenance zones"},{"text":"Access panels"},{"text":"Component identification"},{"text":"Ground servicing"},{"text":"Safety precautions"},{"text":"Tool control"},{"text":"Maintenance documentation"},{"text":"Defect rectification"},{"text":"Functional testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AME Safety Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Aircraft Arrives","Maintenance Requirement","Aircraft Safety / Isolation","Approved Maintenance Data","Inspection","Maintenance / Rectification","Independent / Required Inspection","Functional Test","Documentation","Authorized Release"]},{"type":"p","text":"Only appropriately authorized personnel should perform or certify maintenance tasks within their regulatory privileges."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project Ideas"}]},{"heading":"Aircraft Fault Diagnosis System","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build a simulated system that identifies:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sensor faults"},{"text":"Wiring faults"},{"text":"Power faults"},{"text":"LRU failures"}]}]},{"heading":"Aircraft Engine Trend Monitoring","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EGT"},{"text":"N1/N2"},{"text":"Oil temperature"},{"text":"Oil pressure"},{"text":"Vibration"},{"text":"and detect abnormal trends."}]}]},{"heading":"Aircraft Wiring Fault Detection","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Create a prototype for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Continuity"},{"text":"Short circuit"},{"text":"Open circuit"},{"text":"Insulation faults"}]}]},{"heading":"Predictive Aircraft Maintenance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Use historical maintenance data to predict:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Component failure"},{"text":"Repeated defects"},{"text":"Maintenance intervals"}]}]},{"heading":"Aircraft Structural Health Monitoring","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Monitor:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strain"},{"text":"Vibration"},{"text":"Temperature"}]}]},{"heading":"Digital Maintenance Log","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Create a system for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Defect reporting"},{"text":"Task assignment"},{"text":"Maintenance history"},{"text":"Component tracking"},{"text":"Inspection status"}]}]},{"heading":"Avionics Test Bench","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build a safe educational prototype for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sensor signals"},{"text":"Data buses"},{"text":"Fault injection"},{"text":"Diagnostic algorithms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship / Practical Training Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, approved practical maintenance exposure is significantly more important than a generic engineering internship."},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"h","text":"Airlines"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Line maintenance"},{"text":"Base maintenance"},{"text":"Aircraft engineering"},{"text":"Technical services"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MRO Organizations"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft maintenance"},{"text":"Engine maintenance"},{"text":"Avionics"},{"text":"Components"},{"text":"Structures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Approved Training Organizations"},{"type":"p","text":"Seek organizations operating under the applicable DGCA approval framework."},{"type":"h","text":"Aircraft OEM Ecosystem"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technical support"},{"text":"Aircraft systems"},{"text":"Engineering"},{"text":"Maintenance documentation"},{"text":"Reliability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Entry-Level Career Options"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on licence status, experience and employer requirements:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft Maintenance Engineer Trainee"},{"text":"AME Trainee"},{"text":"Aircraft Maintenance Technician"},{"text":"Junior Aircraft Maintenance Engineer"},{"text":"Aircraft Maintenance Support Engineer"},{"text":"Line Maintenance Engineer"},{"text":"Base Maintenance Engineer"},{"text":"B1 Maintenance Engineer"},{"text":"B2 Avionics Engineer"},{"text":"Aircraft Maintenance Technician — Mechanical"},{"text":"Aircraft Avionics Technician"},{"text":"Aircraft Structures Technician"},{"text":"Maintenance Planning Engineer"},{"text":"Aircraft Reliability Analyst"},{"text":"Technical Services Engineer"},{"text":"Maintenance Control Support Engineer"},{"text":"Aircraft Component Engineer"},{"text":"Aircraft Quality Engineer"},{"text":"Aircraft Inspection Engineer"},{"text":"Continuing Airworthiness Support Engineer"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Note","text":"the title AME and the authority to certify/release aircraft are tied to the applicable licence, category/subcategory, aircraft type and organizational authorization—not simply the possession of a B.Tech degree."},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer/Industry","Most Valuable Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Airline Line Maintenance"},{"text":"Troubleshooting, turnaround maintenance, B1/B2 licence pathway"}],[{"text":"Airline Base Maintenance"},{"text":"Inspection, heavy maintenance, structures/systems"}],[{"text":"MRO"},{"text":"Maintenance practices, documentation, component work"}],[{"text":"Avionics MRO"},{"text":"B2, electronics, wiring, communication/navigation"}],[{"text":"Engine MRO"},{"text":"Turbine engines, inspection, engine systems"}],[{"text":"Technical Services"},{"text":"Engineering analysis, reliability, documentation"}],[{"text":"Aircraft OEM"},{"text":"Systems, structures, engineering support"}],[{"text":"Defence Aviation"},{"text":"Aircraft systems, maintenance, troubleshooting"}],[{"text":"Maintenance Planning"},{"text":"Reliability, planning, technical records"}],[{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"Auditing, compliance, documentation"}],[{"text":"Continuing Airworthiness"},{"text":"Records, AD/SB, maintenance programs"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"DGCA AME Licensing Pathway"},{"type":"p","text":"A simplified career pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["10+2 Physics + Chemistry + Mathematics","AME / Engineering Education & Approved Training Path","DGCA AME Computer Number","CAR-66 Modular Examinations","Required Practical Maintenance Experience","CAR-66 Licence Application / Requirements","B1 or B2 Licence","Aircraft Type Training / Experience","Applicable Aircraft Type / Organizational Authorization","Aircraft Certification Privileges"]},{"type":"p","text":"DGCA's current FAQ states that applicants for AME examination registration must satisfy the CAR-66 eligibility framework, including the stated 10+2 Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics requirement, and that candidates obtain a DGCA AME Computer Number before applying for licence examinations. Pariksha DGCA","url":"https://www.pariksha.dgca.gov.in/Form/AME_FAQs"},{"type":"p","text":"The actual licence route should be planned against the latest CAR-66 and DGCA guidance, because examination syllabi and administrative procedures can be revised. DGCA's 2026 public notice confirms that the examination syllabus has already been updated to CAR-66 Issue III, Revision 2. Pariksha DGCA","url":"https://pariksha.dgca.gov.in/PDFViewer.jsp?pdf=0ECC66E3A238646A2A72DB7DFE97E128"},{"type":"h","text":"B1 Specialization"},{"type":"p","text":"The B1 pathway is especially suitable for candidates interested in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft structures"},{"text":"Engines"},{"text":"Mechanical systems"},{"text":"Hydraulics"},{"text":"Pneumatics"},{"text":"Landing gear"},{"text":"Flight controls"},{"text":"Mechanical troubleshooting"},{"text":"Associated electrical systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["AME Training","B1 Trainee","B1 Aircraft Maintenance Engineer","Type-Qualified B1 AME","Senior B1 AME","B1 Technical Specialist","Maintenance Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"B2 Specialization"},{"type":"p","text":"The B2 pathway is especially suitable for candidates interested in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Avionics"},{"text":"Electrical systems"},{"text":"Navigation"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Instrumentation"},{"text":"Flight computers"},{"text":"Aircraft data systems"},{"text":"Electronic troubleshooting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["AME Training","B2 Trainee","B2 Avionics Engineer","Type-Qualified B2 AME","Senior B2 AME","Avionics Technical Specialist","Avionics / Maintenance Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"Certifications & Learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Priority should be:"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAR-66"},{"text":"CAR-145"},{"text":"DGCA airworthiness framework"},{"text":"Aviation legislation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft maintenance practices"},{"text":"Aircraft systems"},{"text":"Engines"},{"text":"Avionics"},{"text":"Electrical systems"},{"text":"Human factors"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"B1:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft structures"},{"text":"Turbine engines"},{"text":"Hydraulics"},{"text":"Pneumatics"},{"text":"Mechanical systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"B2:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Avionics"},{"text":"Digital systems"},{"text":"Aircraft communication"},{"text":"Navigation"},{"text":"Instrumentation"},{"text":"Wiring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Additional Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NDT awareness"},{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"Technical documentation"},{"text":"Aircraft health monitoring"},{"text":"Data analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"PG Options"},{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate degree is not a substitute for the required AME licensing pathway."},{"type":"p","text":"If pursued, relevant areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aerospace Engineering"},{"text":"Aeronautical Engineering"},{"text":"Aircraft Maintenance Engineering"},{"text":"Avionics"},{"text":"Mechanical Engineering"},{"text":"Systems Engineering"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialized"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft Systems"},{"text":"Aviation Safety"},{"text":"Reliability Engineering"},{"text":"Maintenance Engineering"},{"text":"Aerospace Structures"},{"text":"Aircraft Propulsion"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aviation Management"},{"text":"Maintenance Management"},{"text":"Operations Management"},{"text":"Engineering Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"},{"type":"h","text":"1. B1 Mechanical AME"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engines"},{"text":"Structures"},{"text":"Flight controls"},{"text":"Hydraulics"},{"text":"Pneumatics"},{"text":"Landing gear"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. B2 Avionics AME"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Navigation"},{"text":"Instrumentation"},{"text":"Digital avionics"},{"text":"Flight computers"},{"text":"Aircraft networks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Technical Services Engineer"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Troubleshooting"},{"text":"Engineering analysis"},{"text":"Defect investigation"},{"text":"Maintenance instructions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Aircraft Reliability Engineer"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Component failures"},{"text":"Reliability trends"},{"text":"Repeat defects"},{"text":"Predictive maintenance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Continuing Airworthiness Specialist"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Maintenance programs"},{"text":"Technical records"},{"text":"AD/SB compliance"},{"text":"Configuration management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Maintenance Planning Specialist"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Maintenance schedules"},{"text":"Aircraft utilization"},{"text":"Work packages"},{"text":"Manpower/resources"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"Aircraft maintenance is moving toward connected, predictive and data-driven maintenance."},{"type":"p","text":"Important technologies include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft Health Monitoring"},{"text":"AI fault detection"},{"text":"Predictive maintenance"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Digital technical records"},{"text":"Electronic task cards"},{"text":"Augmented-reality maintenance"},{"text":"Computer vision inspection"},{"text":"Drone inspection"},{"text":"Advanced NDT"},{"text":"IoT sensors"},{"text":"Aircraft data analytics"},{"text":"Automated troubleshooting"},{"text":"Model-based diagnostics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Future Aircraft Maintenance Architecture"},{"type":"flow","items":["Aircraft Sensors","Aircraft Data","Health Monitoring","AI / Analytics","Fault Prediction","Maintenance Planning","Approved Maintenance Task","Inspection / Rectification","Functional Test","Digital Record"]},{"type":"p","text":"AI can support maintenance decision-making, but safety-critical maintenance actions remain governed by approved maintenance data, qualified personnel and applicable regulatory/organizational procedures."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AIRCRAFT SYSTEMS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AIRCRAFT STRUCTURES"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"ENGINE TECHNOLOGY"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"MAINTENANCE PRACTICES"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"TROUBLESHOOTING"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"HYDRAULICS / PNEUMATICS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AIRCRAFT ELECTRICAL"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AVIONICS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AIRCRAFT WIRING"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"NDT"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"HUMAN FACTORS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AVIATION LEGISLATION"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"MAINTENANCE DOCUMENTATION"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AIRWORTHINESS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"CAR-66"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"CAR-145"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"TYPE TRAINING"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"RELIABILITY"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"PREDICTIVE MAINTENANCE"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AIRCRAFT DATA ANALYTICS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By the end of the undergraduate/AME training pathway, the student should have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong aircraft systems knowledge"},{"text":"Strong maintenance-practice skills"},{"text":"Aircraft engine fundamentals"},{"text":"Aircraft structural knowledge"},{"text":"Hydraulic/pneumatic knowledge"},{"text":"Electrical-system knowledge"},{"text":"Avionics knowledge for B2"},{"text":"Systematic troubleshooting ability"},{"text":"Strong technical-document interpretation"},{"text":"AMM/IPC/SRM/FIM familiarity"},{"text":"Human-factors awareness"},{"text":"Aviation legislation knowledge"},{"text":"Aircraft inspection skills"},{"text":"NDT fundamentals"},{"text":"Maintenance documentation skills"},{"text":"Safety-first maintenance habits"},{"text":"Practical aircraft exposure"},{"text":"DGCA examination preparation"},{"text":"Understanding of the B1/B2 licensing pathway"},{"text":"A plan for aircraft type specialization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"For an AME career, a practical maintenance portfolio is more valuable than a conventional software-development portfolio."},{"type":"h","text":"1. Aircraft Systems Technical File"},{"type":"p","text":"Document:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hydraulic system"},{"text":"Electrical system"},{"text":"Fuel system"},{"text":"Flight controls"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Aircraft Fault-Diagnosis Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Demonstrate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Fault","System Diagram","Possible Causes","Diagnostic Tests","Fault Isolation","Corrective Action","Functional Test"]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Engine Trend-Monitoring Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Use simulated/historical data to detect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EGT trends"},{"text":"Vibration"},{"text":"Oil parameters"},{"text":"Abnormal engine behaviour"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Aircraft Wiring Diagnostic Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Continuity testing"},{"text":"Short detection"},{"text":"Open-circuit detection"},{"text":"Connector inspection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Maintenance Documentation Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simulated:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technical log"},{"text":"Defect report"},{"text":"Maintenance task"},{"text":"Inspection record"},{"text":"Troubleshooting report"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Aircraft Structural Inspection Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corrosion"},{"text":"Cracks"},{"text":"Composite damage"},{"text":"NDT methods"}]},{"type":"h","text":"7. Predictive Maintenance Prototype"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Maintenance History"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Sensor Data","Data Processing","Failure Pattern","Risk Prediction","Maintenance Recommendation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"An aircraft maintenance engineering professional specializing in the DGCA CAR-66 B1/B2 pathway, combining aircraft structures, engines, mechanical systems, electrical systems, avionics, maintenance practices, troubleshooting, inspection, human factors, airworthiness regulations and technical documentation to support safe, reliable and compliant aircraft maintenance."},{"type":"h","text":"Strongest positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["CAR-66 B1/B2","Practical Aircraft Maintenance","Troubleshooting","Aircraft Systems","Type Qualification","Reliability"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term progression is:"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Tech/B.E. + AME Training → DGCA CAR-66 Examination Pathway → AME Trainee → B1/B2 Licence Pathway → Aircraft Type Training/Authorization → Licensed B1/B2 AME → Senior AME → Technical Specialist → Maintenance Lead / Technical Services / Continuing Airworthiness."},{"type":"p","text":"DGCA's official Pariksha portal should remain the primary source for current examination schedules, manuals and regulatory instructions; the portal currently publishes 2026 AME examination sessions and updated user-manual information. Pariksha DGCA","url":"https://pariksha.dgca.gov.in/home"}]}]}